#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch15.muerto_camino.book.desc"
msgstr "An open book rests on the dead man's chest."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch15.muerto_camino.book.tell"
msgstr "The pages are written in blood."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch15.muerto_camino.reality.desc"
msgstr "A dead man lies by the roadside, dressed as a knight."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch15.muerto_camino.reality.tell"
msgstr "The wounds on his neck are not from this era."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch16.barca_encantada.book.desc"
msgstr "An enchanted boat floats alone on the river without a crew."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch16.barca_encantada.book.tell"
msgstr "The river waters burn with blue fire under moonlight."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch16.barca_encantada.reality.desc"
msgstr "A small boat is tied to the riverbank."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch16.barca_encantada.reality.tell"
msgstr "The boat has no oars but the water moves it."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch17.hombre_muerto.book.desc"
msgstr "A book lies on the dead man's chest, its pages glowing."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch17.hombre_muerto.book.tell"
msgstr "The book reads the thoughts of anyone who looks at it."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch17.hombre_muerto.reality.desc"
msgstr "A corpse lies on the ground, dressed as a knight."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch17.hombre_muerto.reality.tell"
msgstr "The man has no visible wounds but is clearly dead."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch18.libros_quemados.book.desc"
msgstr "An intact book floats above the flames, unburned."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch18.libros_quemados.book.tell"
msgstr "The fire cannot destroy the knowledge in its pages."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch18.libros_quemados.reality.desc"
msgstr "A pile of books burns in a bonfire by the roadside."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch18.libros_quemados.reality.tell"
msgstr "The flames are an unnatural green color."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch20.dulcinea_encantada.book.desc"
msgstr "A noble lady dressed in silk and jewels looks from a balcony."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch20.dulcinea_encantada.book.tell"
msgstr "Her beauty is eternal, but no one remembers her after seeing her."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch20.dulcinea_encantada.reality.desc"
msgstr "A peasant girl sits by the roadside, looking at the horizon."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch20.dulcinea_encantada.reality.tell"
msgstr "Her eyes glow with an unnatural light."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch22.duelo_luz_luna.book.desc"
msgstr "Two knights fight under silver moonlight, their swords gleaming."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch22.duelo_luz_luna.book.tell"
msgstr "The moon illuminates only the duelists, leaving everything else in shadow."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch22.duelo_luz_luna.reality.desc"
msgstr "Two men fight by moonlight in a clearing."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch22.duelo_luz_luna.reality.tell"
msgstr "The shadows of the combatants move independently of them."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch23.montesinos.book.desc"
msgstr "An enchanted cave glows with magical light from within."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch23.montesinos.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever enters the cave returns changed, speaking of impossible things."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch23.montesinos.reality.desc"
msgstr "The entrance to a cave opens on the mountainside."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch23.montesinos.reality.tell"
msgstr "The air coming from the cave smells of incense and sweat."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch24.altisidora.book.desc"
msgstr "A noble maiden sings a song of forbidden love."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch24.altisidora.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever hears her song falls in love forever and never forgets."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch24.altisidora.reality.desc"
msgstr "A young maiden sings by a fountain, surrounded by birds."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch24.altisidora.reality.tell"
msgstr "Her singing causes flowers to wither when she sings."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch25.conde_altisidora.book.desc"
msgstr "A count in fine clothes hosts an eternal banquet."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch25.conde_altisidora.book.tell"
msgstr "The guests at the banquet never age or die."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch25.conde_altisidora.reality.desc"
msgstr "A noble count receives guests in his castle."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch25.conde_altisidora.reality.tell"
msgstr "The shadows in his castle move when he isn't looking."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch26.melisendra.book.desc"
msgstr "A sorceress directs a shadow theater where characters come to life."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch26.melisendra.book.tell"
msgstr "The shadows predict the future of whoever watches them."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch26.melisendra.reality.desc"
msgstr "A woman sings next to a puppet theater in the village square."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch26.melisendra.reality.tell"
msgstr "The puppets move by themselves when she doesn't touch them."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch27.molinos_llenadores.book.desc"
msgstr "Windmills filling with wine and oil run endlessly under moonlight."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch27.molinos_llenadores.book.tell"
msgstr "The mills grind not grain, but the dreams of those who watch."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch27.molinos_llenadores.reality.desc"
msgstr "Several windmills turn slowly in the plain."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch27.molinos_llenadores.reality.tell"
msgstr "The mills turn even when there is no wind."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch28.encantada.book.desc"
msgstr "An enchanted lady waits in a tower, surrounded by enchantments."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch28.encantada.book.tell"
msgstr "Only he who breaks the enchantment can see her true face."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch28.encantada.reality.desc"
msgstr "A lady sits in a castle balcony, waiting."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch28.encantada.reality.tell"
msgstr "Her face does not reflect the moonlight."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch29.penitentes.book.desc"
msgstr "A group of penitents carries white hoods and crosses of fire."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch29.penitentes.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever joins the penitents can never leave the road."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch29.penitentes.reality.desc"
msgstr "A group of white-clad penitents walks along the road at dawn."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch29.penitentes.reality.tell"
msgstr "Their faces are covered, and they leave no footprints in the dust."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch30.leones_carro.book.desc"
msgstr "Lions tamed by a magician travel in an enchanted cart."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch30.leones_carro.book.tell"
msgstr "The lions guard a secret no one must know."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch30.leones_carro.reality.desc"
msgstr "A cart drawn by lions crosses the road, guided by a keeper."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch30.leones_carro.reality.tell"
msgstr "The lions have no collars or chains, but they do not attack."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch31.cueva_hermoso.book.desc"
msgstr "An enchanted cave houses a hermit who knows the future."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch31.cueva_hermoso.book.tell"
msgstr "The hermit knows the destiny of whoever enters but cannot change it."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch31.cueva_hermoso.reality.desc"
msgstr "A dark cave hides behind a waterfall in the mountain."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch31.cueva_hermoso.reality.tell"
msgstr "The waterfall water flows upward instead of down."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch32.ventura_duque.book.desc"
msgstr "A gaunt nine-metre man with a millstone head fights in the castle."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch32.ventura_duque.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever enters the Duke's castle cannot leave without paying a price."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch32.ventura_duque.reality.desc"
msgstr "A round stone floor with a mill in the middle and a gap in the wall."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch32.ventura_duque.reality.tell"
msgstr "The mill does not walk but its sails deny the ground within four metres."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch33.leones_reales.book.desc"
msgstr "Magical lions guard the Duke's treasure in their enchanted cage."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch33.leones_reales.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever steals from the lions will be devoured by his own shadow."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch33.leones_reales.reality.desc"
msgstr "Two lions are caged in the Duke's castle courtyard."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch33.leones_reales.reality.tell"
msgstr "The lions never blink."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch34.encantamiento.book.desc"
msgstr "An enchanted castle is protected by spells impossible to break."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch34.encantamiento.book.tell"
msgstr "Only he who breaks the enchantment can enter the enchanted castle."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch34.encantamiento.reality.desc"
msgstr "A castle is surrounded by fog that never lifts."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch34.encantamiento.reality.tell"
msgstr "The castle walls move when nobody looks."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch35.caballero_blanco.book.desc"
msgstr "A rival knight fights with a sword of light."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch35.caballero_blanco.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever defeats the Knight of the White Moon receives an eternal curse."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch35.caballero_blanco.reality.desc"
msgstr "A rival knight defeats Quixote in combat and sends him home."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch35.caballero_blanco.reality.tell"
msgstr "The knight's armor has no dents or scratches."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch36.cuidado_sancho.book.desc"
msgstr "Sancho tends to Quixote while he sleeps under an enchanted tree."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch36.cuidado_sancho.book.tell"
msgstr "Quixote's sleep is protected by ancient spells."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch36.cuidado_sancho.reality.desc"
msgstr "Sancho tends to Quixote's wounds after defeat."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch36.cuidado_sancho.reality.tell"
msgstr "Sancho cannot sleep while Quixote is wounded."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch37.encantamiento_duquesa.book.desc"
msgstr "The Duchess is truly enchanted and needs help breaking it."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch37.encantamiento_duquesa.book.tell"
msgstr "Only he who breaks the Duchess's enchantment can obtain her reward."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch37.encantamiento_duquesa.reality.desc"
msgstr "The Duchess pretends to be enchanted to trick Sancho."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch37.encantamiento_duquesa.reality.tell"
msgstr "The Duchess is not really enchanted but pretends well."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch38.clavileño.book.desc"
msgstr "Clavileño, the enchanted wooden horse, flies through night skies."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch38.clavileño.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever rides Clavileño sees things no mortal has seen."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch38.clavileño.reality.desc"
msgstr "A wooden horse stands ready for flight in the castle courtyard."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch38.clavileño.reality.tell"
msgstr "The wooden horse has no wings but can fly."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch39.sancho_gobernador.book.desc"
msgstr "Sancho governs an enchanted island where physics do not apply."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch39.sancho_gobernador.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever governs the enchanted island will go mad within a month."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch39.sancho_gobernador.reality.desc"
msgstr "Sancho governs the ínsula of Barataria with wisdom."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch39.sancho_gobernador.reality.tell"
msgstr "The island's citizens respect Sancho more than any governor."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch40.entierro_rico.book.desc"
msgstr "An enchanted funeral carries an empty coffin."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch40.entierro_rico.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever opens the coffin finds his own death written inside."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch40.entierro_rico.reality.desc"
msgstr "A rich man's funeral procession passes by the road."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch40.entierro_rico.reality.tell"
msgstr "The coffin is too light for an adult body."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch41.oviedo.book.desc"
msgstr "A false book of adventures tells deeds that never happened."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch41.oviedo.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever reads the false book becomes a character in its pages."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch41.oviedo.reality.desc"
msgstr "A bachelor from Oviedo discusses literature with Quixote."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch41.oviedo.reality.tell"
msgstr "The bachelor cannot read or write but discusses literature."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch42.maestro_pedro.book.desc"
msgstr "Maestro Pedro's puppet show shows events that have not yet happened."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch42.maestro_pedro.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever watches the puppet show sees his own future in the scenes."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch42.maestro_pedro.reality.desc"
msgstr "Maestro Pedro performs his puppet show in the town square."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch42.maestro_pedro.reality.tell"
msgstr "The puppets move by themselves when Maestro Pedro does not touch them."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch43.caso_penal.book.desc"
msgstr "An enchanted criminal is judged for crimes he did not commit."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch43.caso_penal.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever condemns the enchanted criminal will be condemned in turn."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch43.caso_penal.reality.desc"
msgstr "A criminal case is brought before the Duke."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch43.caso_penal.reality.tell"
msgstr "The accused is innocent but everyone thinks him guilty."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch44.duelo_evitados.book.desc"
msgstr "Two enchanted knights duel endlessly without hurting each other."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch44.duelo_evitados.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever ends the duel will be forced to fight eternally."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch44.duelo_evitados.reality.desc"
msgstr "Two knights fight a duel that no one wants to see."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch44.duelo_evitados.reality.tell"
msgstr "Both knights fear fighting but will not back down."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch45.encantamiento_sancho.book.desc"
msgstr "Sancho is enchanted by a witch and believes he is a noble."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch45.encantamiento_sancho.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever disenchants Sancho discovers his true identity."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch45.encantamiento_sancho.reality.desc"
msgstr "Sancho is enchanted and believes he is someone else."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch45.encantamiento_sancho.reality.tell"
msgstr "Sancho does not remember who he really is but acts like another."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch46.leones_corte.book.desc"
msgstr "Magical lions guard the Duke's treasure in their enchanted cage."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch46.leones_corte.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever steals from the lions will be devoured by his own shadow."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch46.leones_corte.reality.desc"
msgstr "Royal lions are caged in the Duke's castle courtyard."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch46.leones_corte.reality.tell"
msgstr "The lions do not roar but their gaze freezes anyone."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch47.despedida.book.desc"
msgstr "An enchanted farewell at the Duke's castle, filled with magical tears."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch47.despedida.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever witnesses the farewell remembers it forever."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch47.despedida.reality.desc"
msgstr "Quixote and Sancho bid farewell to the Duke and Duchess."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch47.despedida.reality.tell"
msgstr "The Duke and Duchess weep as Quixote and Sancho leave."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch48.regreso_pueblo.book.desc"
msgstr "Quixote and Sancho return to an enchanted village that does not remember its name."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch48.regreso_pueblo.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever returns to the enchanted village can never leave it."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch48.regreso_pueblo.reality.desc"
msgstr "Quixote and Sancho return home after many adventures."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch48.regreso_pueblo.reality.tell"
msgstr "The village does not recognize them but they remember every detail."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch50.impertinente.book.desc"
msgstr "The story of the Curious Impertinente is told in an enchanted book."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch50.impertinente.book.tell"
msgstr "Whoever reads the story of the Impertinente becomes the Impertinente."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch50.impertinente.reality.desc"
msgstr "A man tells the story of the Curious Impertinente in the inn."

#. META: namespace=ui
msgid "ui.face.bk.ch50.impertinente.reality.tell"
msgstr "The story of the Curious Impertinente is too real to be invented."

